# The indexer already skips whatever .gitignore ignores, so a line here is only
# for a path git tracks or leaves untracked: stray binaries outside bin/, the
# rest of .claude/cache/, and staging/, where a .claude change waits to apply.
**/*.dll
**/*.pdb
.claude/cache/
staging/

# Closed records: never edited to match the code (CLAUDE.md), so a hit there is
# history rather than the answer; grep them instead.
docs/superpowers/
docs/pr-decision-log.md
docs/lessons.md

# Generated EF Core migrations. They are 10% of the C# corpus and took 13% of
# the top-three result slots, crowding out the code a question is about; the
# filenames and `git log` are how a schema change is found instead.
**/*.Designer.cs
**/Migrations/
